{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上三首用徹悟禪師韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五師即下五通也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以下俱用三一居士原韻，辛未秋著。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五通，乃天竺雞頭摩寺僧也。徃西方求佛形儀，後返，佛已現於\n樹葉上，即以丹青傳模，故有此也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漁父"}
